# L §5.18 inputs-of ref: "the set of rows its evaluation read, with their sources (N-1705), the rows an at reads
# included; a rule's v version isn't a row ... For marginal, the rows it sums (lo < x)."  Row stable ids: L §2.5
# (version:target[keys]; a band row with its interval).  With x = 500 only the row [0, 1000) is summed.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "the act"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

band tiers(x: num PLN): num
input w: num PLN
input pay_day: date

def tax: num PLN at pay_day
  rule base = marginal(tiers, w)

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2025-12-01
  tiers: [0, 1000) = 10 % "art. 1"
  tiers: [1000, inf) = 20 % "art. 2"
  w = 500 PLN

version d
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  pay_day = 2026-03-01

ask q1: inputs-of tax
=== expect
q1:
  d:pay_day (source s "the act")
  v:tiers [0, 1 000) (source s "the act", locator "art. 1")
  v:w (source s "the act")
  cut 2026-12-31
